      "Scout forage chance is min(100, 15 + foraging * 0.8), tested against a random roll from zero through eighty.",
      "Successful forage awards authored food on rolls 0-159, bait on 160-199, and a treasure map on 200, with independent bonus-item chances at Scout Camps III and Scout Master.",
